	"Description": "A expansion mod for [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/9346]Organic Lamps\u00A0[/url]\u00A0&lt;--(Required)\n<br />Want more lamps?\n<br />-[b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/13235/]Neon Signs[/url][/b]\u00A0add-on\n<br />Want to start decorating faster?\n<br />-[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/13204]Catalogues are Cheap[/url]\n<br />\n<br />Adds 7 colored lamps based on minerals.\n<br />\n<br />All recipes needs :\n<br />-10 [color=#999999]stone[/color] units\n<br />-The mineral of the lamp :\n<br />   \uFEFF+[color=#dd7e6b]Helvite[/color]\n<br />   \uFEFF+[color=#f6b26b]Orpiment[/color]\n<br />   \uFEFF+[color=#ffe599]Pyrite[/color]\n<br />   \uFEFF+[color=#b6d7a8]Jamborite[/color]\n<br />   \uFEFF+[color=#a4c2f4]Kyanite[/color]\n<br />   \uFEFF+[color=#ea9999]Dolomite[/color]\n<br />   \uFEFF+[color=#b4a7d6]Obsidian[/color]\n<br />\n<br />-To install just get the listed mods on \"Requirements\"\n<br />And unpack this .rar file inside your \"Mods\" folder\n<br />\n<br />-The location of the Mineral Bench is the same as the \"Organic Lamps\" mod.\n<br />On Robin´s workshop behind her counter in her house.\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />They all can be powered with a [color=#ffe599]Sap [/color]unit.",
